-- נספחים ב'2 ו־ג'2 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102): the Ofek 2022 supplement of a second-degree (MA)
-- teacher, by grade — from 1.9.2022 (annex ב'2) and, twice as much, from
-- 1.9.2023 (annex ג'2) — as the corpus publishes them among the tables. They
-- are annexes ב2 and ג2 of the wage agreement of 19.10.2022, whose §5
-- pays the supplement by them, and which the agreement's signed copy prints
-- after its signatures (encoded, imported).
--
-- Checked here: each is the signed copy's annex grade for grade and prints
-- the day §5 applies it from. Like those annexes they are printed to the
-- shekel; the follow-up committee's decision of 14.1.2025 (§3, imported)
-- replaced them by annexes printed to the agora, and every amount here is
-- the decision's to the nearest shekel.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2025-01-14_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakev_taut-sofer-correction_agorot-salary-tables`

§ `נספחים ב'2 ו־ג'2 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102)`

-- The page prints no label over annex ב'2: the corpus reads it at the foot of the
-- page before (`2022-09-01_ofek-hadash_salary-table_MA`, its hc_1/p4).

-- Annex ב'2: from 1.9.2022, as it prints under it.
@ref akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/t1 akn:hc_1/p2
`annex ב'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102)" (JUST 102) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
        (LIST `cell` 1 832, `cell` 2 701, `cell` 3 570, `cell` 4 439, `cell` 5 307, `cell` 6 176, `cell` 7 97, `cell` 8 19, `cell` 9 0)

-- akn:hc_1/p3 The next annex's label, "נספח ג' 2"; the table below is that annex.

-- Annex ג'2: from 1.9.2023, as it prints under it.
@ref akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/t2 akn:hc_1/p5
`annex ג'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102)" (JUST 102) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023)
        (LIST `cell` 1 1665, `cell` 2 1402, `cell` 3 1140, `cell` 4 877, `cell` 5 615, `cell` 6 352, `cell` 7 195, `cell` 8 37, `cell` 9 0)

-- akn:hc_1/p6 "נספחים א1-א9, ב1-ב7 מוסכמים": the parties' note that the annexes are agreed; no rule of its own.

§§ `בדיקת הטבלאות`

-- (1) The days: §5.1's 1.9.2022 and §5.2's 1.9.2023, as the signed copy's
-- annexes print them.
#ASSERT `annex ב'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` `annex ב2 of the signed copy`
#ASSERT `annex ג'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` `annex ג2 of the signed copy`

-- (2) The signed copy's annexes ב2 and ג2, grade for grade, nine grades each.
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the signed copy's supplement for MA in` a IS
    GIVEN g YIELD `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` a) 0 g

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for MA in` `annex ב2 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for MA in` `annex ג2 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for MA in` `annex ב2 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 9
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for MA in` `annex ג2 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 9

-- (3) The decision of 14.1.2025: its annexes ב2 and ג2, printed to the agora,
-- govern in these annexes' place; every amount here is theirs to the
-- nearest shekel (convention rounding.half).
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the decision's supplement for MA to the shekel in` a IS
    GIVEN g YIELD
        CONSIDER `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` a) 0 g
        WHEN JUST x THEN JUST (`to the nearest whole` x)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the decision's supplement for MA to the shekel in` `annex ב2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ב'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the decision's supplement for MA to the shekel in` `annex ג2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ג'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))

-- The supplements at work: §5's supplement for a half position at grade
-- 1 on 1.9.2022, as the signed copy pays it, beside annex ב'2.
#ASSERT `the published supplement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) `annex ב'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` 1 EQUALS JUST (416 TIMES 2)
#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` 2 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1 0.5 EQUALS JUST 416
#ASSERT `the published supplement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2023) `annex ג'2 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` 1 EQUALS NOTHING
